  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PIP-Increased capacity of the MEDT in planning, monitoring and reporting on the national development programs and strategies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this Initiation Plan is to support the Government of Tajikistan in enhancing the capacity of the Ministry of Economic Development and Trade of the Republic of Tajikistan in planning, monitoring and reporting on the national development programs and strategies (i.e. Mid-term development programs 2021-2025, 2026-2030 and the National Development Strategy 2030) and its alignment with SDGs. By strengthening the capacity of key stakeholders in monitoring and reporting, the project will</narrative>
  </description>
